From 3ff729c2efae77888f12f52e907f9a860d566fbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tomtomnet <tompere8000@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 08:45:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] virtio-gpu: guest vblank locked to the host's
 presentation, flush fences, blob leak fix

- x-host-vblank / x-vblank-lead / x-vblank-lead-auto / x-vblank-swap-target: the
  guest's vblank ticks follow the host compositor's presentation feedback, a lead
  before each host vblank, regulated on the median swap-to-screen time
- the resource flush of a blob scanout completes with a fence once the host has it
- virtio_gpu_virgl_resource_unref(): free res->base.addrs (the guest-memory
  blob's page array leaked on every resource unref: +45 MB/min during window
  resizes; upstream has the same bug)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01M8iTzFPtyk2Gzbt6CLnRYK
